  "coverage": "15 current counties, 357 municipalities and five separately identified territories/dependencies. GISCO 2024 1:1m land geometry cross-checked against current Kartverket codes; all 357 codes agree. Official SSB January 2026 population and land area. Svalbard, Jan Mayen, Bouvet and Peter I use Norwegian Polar Institute coastline polygons, including glacier-covered land and excluding lakes. Queen Maud Land is explicitly an Antarctic claim, clipped to real Antarctic land and 85°S for the map. Svalbard and Jan Mayen are parts of Norway, not counties; Bouvet, Peter I and Queen Maud Land are dependencies. No marine administrative polygons are filled as land.",
